 work: https://github.com/oracle/graalvm-reachability-metadata/tree/ai%2Fkimeta%2Fhuman-intervention%2Fissue-10324-fails-native-image-run-org.jetbrains.kotlin-kotlin-daemon-embeddable-2.5.0-Beta1-2f58645f\n\nThe metadata repair and dynamic-access tasks completed successfully, and the report found the single tracked dynamic-access call covered. The likely blocker is that the existing native test does not make the runtime logging failure fatal: Gradle reported all 11 tests successful while stderr contained `ClassNotFoundException: java.util.logging.FileHandler` from `KotlinCompileDaemonBase.mainImpl`. Across three generation attempts, the agent proposed asserting the daemon log contents, but no test change was retained. Metrics confirm `test_generation_failed`, 3 iterations, 0 generated LOC, no metadata artifact, and identical starting/ending commits.\n\nInspect:\n- `logs/org.jetbrains.kotlin:kotlin-daemon-embeddable:2.5.0-Beta1/issue-requested-metadata/pi.log`\n- `logs/org.jetbrains.kotlin:kotlin-daemon-embeddable:2.5.0-Beta1/issue-requested-metadata/pi-generation-2026-10-06T23-02-35-042942Z.log`\n- `logs/org.jetbrains.kotlin:kotlin-daemon-embeddable:2.5.0-Beta1/dynamic-access-report/generateDynamicAccessCoverageReport-2026-10-06T22-56-30-542104Z.log`\n- `logs/org.jetbrains.kotlin:kotlin-daemon-embeddable:2.5.0-Beta1/native-image-run-fix/fixTestNativeImageRun-2026-10-06T22-52-59-675744Z.log`\n\nManual next steps:\n1. Reproduce the native run and confirm the `FileHandler` exception, also checking the observed `kotlin-reflect:1.6.10` versus Kotlin `2.5.0-Beta1` classpath mismatch.\n2. Refine `KotlinCompileDaemonBaseTest` so daemon logging failure is observable, for example by asserting the configured log contains the expected version and argument messages.\n3. Regenerate metadata and rerun the coordinate-scoped clean native test plus metadata validation.", "textSignature": "{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_099ba82ef36cb246016ac57eaeee3887d083b5d35d2666fb08\",\"phase\":\"final_ans